Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know your way around a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll grant you that much,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it will take much more\Nthan mere ego if you think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be defeated by the time\Nthe flames reach twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your pride may well be your\Nundoing, mister...uh...who?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardonnez-moi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't been introduced yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Jean-Pierre Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well met, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to know the\Nname of one's opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to the task at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're under the\Nassumption that my flames only
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,burn upward or with the wind\Nas they would in nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me assure you they do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand is named Magician's Red because\Nit wields fire as though by magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire is what began life\Nitself in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have expected as much from\Na fiery stand such as Magician's Red,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who represents beginnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.48,0:01:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, you dare to\Nspeak of pride and ego?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.22,0:01:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assure you that my\Npride is well deserved!
