Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.58,0:01:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the fraction of a second\Nthat the coins lined up,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he skewered all five of them\Nin a single shot! No. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.18,0:01:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a look at him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, stuck on the blade of his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's cut a bit of flame\Nfor every coin that he hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you see that I'm every\Nbit as deadly as I had said.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not mere ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand has the unrestricted power to cut
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fire to ribbons as though it were nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can slice through air, creating\Na vacuum and guiding the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.78,0:01:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your flames are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Face it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your magician's red may be fearsome,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's powerless against the\Nlikes of my silver chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory and conquest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That represents the card, the\Nchariot, and defines my stand as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can beat you in this cramped little\Nplace as well as anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.74,0:02:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not very sporting, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your flames will serve you to greater\Neffect in a larger open space.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beating you at the apex\Nof your powers, Monsieur,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.40,0:02:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the only victory worthy of my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you, follow me outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.49,0:04:06.62,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,475)\pos(192,820)}Episode 5: Silver Chariot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of nonsense is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe they call it\NTiger Balm Garden. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiger Balm Garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fantastical hillside park built\Nalong Hong Kong's famous Tai Hang Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With its surreal landscape of sculptures\Nand pagodas, it is a true Hong Kong oddity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A prediction, if I may indulge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.38,0:04:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsieur Avdol, you will die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroyed by the flames of your\Nvery own stand, Magician's Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, Jotaro, this is not your fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In an open space like this one, there's\Nnothing to keep my stand from fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at full force.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,En Card!
