Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sign of the flame you\Nwere crying about before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall press the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goddamn bastard,\Nhe's just toying with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used Magician's Red on\Nfireballs to make a statue of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a place this odd, I dare say\Nyour fiendish face is right at home.
