Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me your true power at last, Avdol,\Nbut know that it will never be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hide behind something already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:06:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol's gonna blow his top.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crossfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the best that you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you before what my sword does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It creates a gap between the pockets\Nof air so I can slice your flames!
