Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fire is so intense, it's\Nburning Stan and user alike!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just as I foretold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will die from an inferno\Nof your own making. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief, just die already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last pathetic gasp,\Nthis is hard to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hit felt wrong, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:06:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can his stand injure me after\Nthe moment of its own destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.18,0:07:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the stand, you\Nbastard, it's a dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flames blinded your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you really destroyed was the statue\Nthat Silver Chariot carved earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you didn't take\Nme at my word when I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,told you that I could\Ncontrol my flames freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you deflected it, I used it to melt\Nthe statue's joints and allow it to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one defeated by his own\Nstance powers is you, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's try this again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crossfire Hurricane! SHINE!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Challenging a fortune-teller in a\Nbattle of predictions is a bold move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it another decade and you\Nwould have been a viable opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such terrifying power!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand must have melted in\Nthe face of such an attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one hell of a burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:07:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm betting he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.76,0:08:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or wishes he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's not getting up from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.74,0:08:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he is alive, he'll be\Nflat on his back for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having your stand destroyed\Nis a major trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, let us resume\Nour trek to Egypt. Hmm.
