Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is he still lying down\Nbut suspended in midair?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, Monsieur Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look injured at all! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Why the hell is he\Nfloating in the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look with your inner\Neye and see the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.24,0:08:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.08,0:08:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.22,0:08:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me well, monsieur.
