Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.78,0:09:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem quite taken aback by this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really should explain\Nbefore I destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it wouldn't be\Nchivalrous, don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you were expecting\Nnothing less, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May we take a short time\Nout for an explanation? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.58,0:09:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear this explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, the explosion you saw was\Nnot my stand self-destructing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you took as Silver\NChariot's armor was body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor that was cast off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before it did, it absorbed\Nthe brunt of your flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I escaped further harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And bereft of armor, it has\Nsignificantly more agility.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you able to see my\Nstand as it held me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Chariot can now\Nmove faster than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Illuminating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.97,0:09:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're suggesting it only stood\Nthere and took my crossfire
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hurricane head-on because the\Narmor didn't allow it to dodge,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But bereft of armor, it is\Nalso far more vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may have survived\Nmy attack once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if it were hit again, its\Ndestruction would be absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can one know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.52,0:10:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a shame, we'll never find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, mind if I try it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.94,0:10:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, let me show you all something\Nthat will really freak you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, go ahead then.
