Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.08,0:10:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There should only be one stand per user.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you freaked out yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are after images.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect mirrors of the Silver Chariot,\NGuaranteed to fool your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.50,0:10:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sight, your hearing, your senses\Ncan't follow their movement. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like\Ninsultsmanship now, monsieur?
