Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suffer my Red Bind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you that efforts to track\Nit would be in vain, did I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You waste your flame on images\Nand spare the real threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Striking at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperation is not a good\Nlook on you, my dear Abdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to exhaust\Nhimself at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crossfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurricane!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Menon, menon, menon, menon, menon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you learned nothing at all today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fool whose attacks will\Nnot work on my stand! Now give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haptor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.72,0:12:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What precision, what lethal\Nefficiency, it's plain to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand's ability has been\Ntrained, and at great length!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I've spent the last\Ndecade honing my skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.34,0:12:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had better hit me with\Neverything you've got,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for I intend my next attack\Nto be the coup de grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very chivalrous of you to keep giving\Nme fair warning about your next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your honor is unimpeachable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've inspired me. Thus, I too will\Ngive fair warning before my next attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.06,0:12:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,varieties than the one\Nyou've already seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a flame in the shape of an\Nankh but it need not remain whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can divide it into as\Nmany pieces as I deem fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crossfire Hurricane Special!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try and dodge them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.50,0:13:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fool, Abbacchio, it's useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, they've got him covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's thought of everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naive, naive, naive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.58,0:13:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So very naive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will wield this divided flame\Nagainst you precisely as I did before!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slice it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And hurl it back!
