Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.64,0:13:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the hole that was\Ndug by the flames earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.52,0:13:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get it! It's clear to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first shot was a\Nsetup and nothing more!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he used the tunnel to hit\Nhim with Crossfire Hurricane!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, that attack can be divided\Nup into as many pieces as are called for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burning is a painful\Nway to meet one's end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the knife and end it while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My conceit was my undoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't picture his fire standing\Na chance against my sword work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A slow death amid the flames is\Nno less than I deserve, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I challenged you to this duel\Nand you were the clear victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would not sully it with suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be cowardly to end it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even in your final moments, you\Nconduct yourself with chivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.18,0:15:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How easy it would have been for you to\Nthrow that knife into my unsuspecting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even while working for a devil like\NDio, you've carried yourself with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your death would be a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something must have set\Nhim down this dark path.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.52,0:15:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.26,0:15:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those tentacles are so gross,\NI can't even look at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just destroy the damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit your bitchin', old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.94,0:15:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that my grandson has pulled out\Nthat flesh, bud, we can all be buddies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.82,0:15:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't people who make stupid puns all the\Ntime get on your nerves, or is it just me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Speedwagon Foundation\Nchartered a boat for us yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With any luck, it's reached\Nthe harbor ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's on your mind, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thanked you properly for\Nfreeing me from Dio's mind control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young Jojo is the one you\Nshould be thanking here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't need your thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears your fine manners\Nare wasted on the likes of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish, I've no desire\Nto come off as heavy-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not quite finished here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsieur Joestar, I hope you'll indulge\Nmy asking a very bizarre question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bizarre question, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I noticed at the restaurant\Nyesterday that you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never took off your\Ngloves even while eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, your left hand wouldn't happen\Nto be a right hand under that glove?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is my left hand a right one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't kidding\Nabout the bizarre part.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you hoping to\Nfind out through all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for the man who\Nmurdered my younger sister.
