Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I lost a real thing in a\Nhorrible battle some 50 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.66,0:17:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for the rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me if it's not\Ntoo painful to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My younger sister and a classmate of hers\Nwere walking home from school in the rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.62,0:17:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back in our native France.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a country road,\Nmuch like any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the side of the road, a man\Nstood with his back to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oddly enough, the\Nmysterious stranger was dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rain fell in torrents around him, as\Nthough an invisible shell guarded him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her friend fell to the\Nground in a fountain of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blood as though her chest\Nwas cut by the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sister was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stole her innocence\Nand then he killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was all the man wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For that she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.52,0:18:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her friend escaped with her life to\Ntell me what she saw that fateful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't get a good look\Nat their tormentors' face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But saw that both of his\Nhands were right hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one believed the poor\Ngirl's testimony about the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one but me. That is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had already been keeping my own\Nstrange powers a secret by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.14,0:18:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he sounded like a fellow stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a stand user all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swore an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised my sister's soul that I would\Navenge her to hunt down the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and make him pay with his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would use my own stand as a\Ntool of righteous vengeance!
