Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That... man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reflection shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a vision from your heart, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man you seek, the pain you hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My power only makes it visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Care to become friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tragedy gnaws away at your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need no glass to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Work with me and your suffering will soon\Nbe nothing more than a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The image in the globe is\Nwhat pains you, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I could help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.18,0:19:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I too am plagued with misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been denied the\Nsun's embrace forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be an agent of my will out in the sunlight
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I will find this\Nman who haunts you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I was commanded\Nto kill all four of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.14,0:20:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never once did I question my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he hadn't used a flesh bud,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio is quite the master at manipulating\Nhuman beings to carry out his bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if Dio has found your sister's killer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might safely assume he's enlisted the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.32,0:20:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,villain in whatever dark\Nplans he's got afoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that is true, I must join you\Non your trek to Egypt, messieurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By going after Dio, I will find\Nthe one who took my sister's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no objections to him coming.
