Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.22,0:21:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The honor is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.72,0:21:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.63,0:21:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but could I bug you\Nto take our picture, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a good excuse to talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, will you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take it with the ocean behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go bug someone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.70,0:21:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, mon ami.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies, I would love to\Ntake your photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come along. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have very nice legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.78,0:21:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to get them in the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfection!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And another one for safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Très Bone,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if only I could use this camera to capture\Nyour hearts instead of just your picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nothing like the\NApollo of a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.04,0:21:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like his emotions change on a dime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More like he's got two brains and the one
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,downstairs suddenly\Nstarted calling the shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.78,0:22:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.20,0:22:15.66,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.66,0:22:17.91,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.91,0:22:19.33,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.80,0:22:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.17,0:22:22.63,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the birds are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.63,0:22:24.96,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got their money on a bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.96,0:22:27.26,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.26,0:22:28.68,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.47,0:22:31.93,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling tight to the hookah, I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.93,0:22:34.06,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.78,0:22:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.10,0:22:43.65,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.86,0:22:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.56,0:22:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.04,0:22:57.50,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.50,0:22:59.87,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.52,0:22:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.52,0:23:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.87,0:23:01.12,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.04,0:23:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.13,0:23:04.50,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they bring you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.20,0:23:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books.
