Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.96,0:23:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on a boat, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.52,0:23:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ditch the uniform already!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now, I'm a good student, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.92,0:23:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar. Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.38,0:23:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take all you guys at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.94,0:23:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're stand-disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.08,0:23:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever one inhales any cigarette\Nsmoke, the true nature is revealed.
